# 🚀 ORBITAL: Mission Control — Dev Setup & Run

### 1. Initial Setup (Run Once)

Open PowerShell or Command Prompt in the project folder and run:

```powershell
.\setup.bat
```

> *Or if using pnpm directly:*
> ```powershell
> pnpm.cmd install
> pnpm.cmd db:setup
> ```

---

### 2. Start the App

```powershell
.\dev.bat
```

> *Or if using pnpm directly:*
> ```powershell
> pnpm.cmd dev
> ```

This automatically starts both the **Frontend** and **Backend** together.

---

### 3. Open in Browser

- **Game (Frontend):** [http://localhost:5173](http://localhost:5173)
- **Backend API:** [http://localhost:4000](http://localhost:4000)
- **Health Check:** [http://localhost:4000/health](http://localhost:4000/health)

---

### Useful Commands

| Task | Command |
|---|---|
| Reset local database | `pnpm.cmd db:reset` |
| Run tests | `pnpm.cmd test` |
| Check types | `pnpm.cmd typecheck` |
